jsPDF AutoTable plugin v3.8.2
https://github.com/simonbengtsson/jsPDF-AutoTable

Vendored into FreeITSM so that PDF export works on an install with no outbound
internet access from the browser. It was previously loaded from
cdnjs.cloudflare.com, which meant "Save to PDF" silently did nothing on an
air-gapped or CDN-blocked network. Upstream publishes no standalone LICENSE
file; the copyright line below is taken verbatim from the distributed file's
own header.

